# Static roots served by Caddy, mounted read-only at /srv in the caddy container.
#
# The built LedgerGuard dashboard lives in ./ledgerguard here on the droplet — the
# output of `npm run build` in shell/, copied across at deploy time. Build artefacts
# are not committed (see .gitignore), so this file exists to keep the mount point in
# the repository; a missing ./www would make Docker create it as a root-owned
# directory and Caddy would serve 404s from an empty root.
